00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:04.330
Stop this car!

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:06.570
Mr. Bridesdale, you tricked us.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:09.610
You just took us out of jail so you could bring us back up here to prison.

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:12.140
Head for the hills, everybody!

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:14.740
No, wait! Come back!

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:17.130
The prison is at your home!

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:20.410
Stop it! Listen to me!

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:21.760
Wait! Come back!

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.810
Ready!

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:11.080
This has been a Filmways presentation.
